      "Attempt 1 creates a new copied r015 head from r014 and changes explicitly enumerated anatomical-right orbital, nasal sidewall, columella-flank and upper-lip-support controls. It asserts positive-X/local bounds and unchanged left/midline cage coordinates before normal recalculation.",
