      "The five shared profile controls lie within the columella, philtrum and upper-lip support region in the supplied baseline coordinate snapshot. Parent explicitly identified this shared-midline exception before closeout; this report does not independently certify user authorization.",
      "No smoothing operator, iterative broad surface smoothing, Mirror modifier, mirror operation, or copying of the corrected region across the face appears in the reviewed local scripts. Face normals are recalculated on the copied candidates; this is separate from moving the cage.",
      "No source statement modifies original hair, braid, eyebrows, eyelashes, torso or armor geometry. The attempt scripts target HP1 head copies only and save only the intended HP1 work file.",
      "No material-node changes occur in the local scripts. The cage-review copy reuses HP1_Cage_Diagnostic_Ink in its copied mesh material list without editing the material contents.",
      "Render helpers temporarily mirror HP1 key/fill light positions and hide diagnostic-eye copies for evidence. try/finally restores those transforms and visibility. This is lighting diagnosis, not geometry mirroring.",
